# Contact & email APIs

## Path

```
POST /api/contact | /api/newsletter
  → EMAIL_SERVICE_URL (default https://mernify.co/api/email)
  → x-email-secret: EMAIL_SECRET
  → CONTACT_TO (default info@mernify.co)
```

- Shared: `functions/_lib/contactMail.js`
- Handlers: `functions/api/contact.js`, `functions/api/newsletter.js`
- Local mirror: `vite.config.js` (reload `.env` per request)

## Success contract

- Real delivery only; include `"provider":"email-microservice"` on success
- Honeypot bots may get silent fake OK; humans must not

## Client

- Contact forms use `submitContactForm` → `/api/contact` (same origin)
- Do not call the mail microservice from the browser with secrets

## Env (server only)

`EMAIL_SERVICE_URL`, `EMAIL_SECRET`, `CONTACT_TO`
